  "description": "A princess trapped in a tower, guarded by a dragon, awaiting rescue by Prince Charming. Sound familiar? But what if the rescue doesn’t arrive in time? After ten years of waiting, Princess Elina is finally saved at the age of 28 by Prince Louis. Sure, he’s from a faraway kingdom that Elina’s never heard of and has a few weird personality quirks, but at least she’s not alone anymore! That is, until a jealous witch curses him and turns him into a five-year-old child… \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
